        "tag": "blockquote",
        "text": "What to Expect When You're Expecting, 5th edition, Heidi Murkoff. WhatToExpect.com, Can I Avoid an Episiotomy? April 2025. WhatToExpect.com, Vaginal Tears During and After Childbirth, August 2023. WhatToExpect.com, Benefits of a Sitz Bath After Birth, April 2022. American College of Obstetricians and Gynecologists, Practice Bulletin Number 198: Prevention and Management of Obstetric Lacerations at Vaginal Delivery, September 2018, reaffirmed 2025. American College of Obstetricians and Gynecologists, Ob-Gyns Can Prevent and Manage Obstetric Lacerations During Vaginal Delivery, Says New ACOG Practice Bulletin, June 2016. Johns Hopkins Medicine, Episiotomy, 2025. Mayo Clinic, Episiotomy: When It's Needed, When It's Not, August 2022. The LeapFrogGroup, C-Section Rates Hold Steady, While Episiotomy Rates Drop in New National Maternity Care Report from The Leapfrog Group, March 2025.",
        "text_sha256": "eebd54a1ab786cdec394c81b96b95d4096578dd49b215a83ff05b5100feaaf4c",
        "word_count": 121
      },
      {
